  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If an user objects to personal data processing under legal provisions such as the GDPR for personalizated recommendations of worlds, I anticipate the personal data should no longer be processed for personalizing world recommendations.\n\nIt may be a good idea to hide or disable the world upvoting system for these users, to avoid collecting data VRChat assumably can't process in the first place from the user for some uses.\n\nI am on a previous personalization exemption list, and I can currently see and interact with the world upvotes system in open beta Build `1948`. It's unclear if this is intended or not.",
